printer-driver-fp620kp (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix missing horizontal strokes in small CJK text at 360x180: ask CUPS
    for a 360x360 raster and combine row pairs back to 180 dpi, keeping the
    single-pass 360x180 output.
  * Use the MIT license consistently in the source headers.

 -- johnwoo <johnwoo@example.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:41:00 +0800

printer-driver-fp620kp (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * CUPS filter and USB backend for ESC/P2K, with status readback.
  * PPD with 180x180, 360x180 and 360x360 dpi modes; 360x180
    unidirectional is the default.
  * Add fp620kp-setup helper for queue creation.

 -- johnwoo <johnwoo@example.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:15:00 +0800
